# QA evidence screenshots — regenerable Playwright captures.
# NOT unreferenced: docs/qa/responsive-audit-2026-08.md cites sixteen paths
# inside this directory as its evidence. They are deliberately not tracked
# (11 MB of PNGs that go stale the moment the stylesheet they document
# changes), so those citations record what was captured and at which width
# rather than linking a file you can open. Regenerate with the Method
# section of that audit. The similarly-named docs/qa/screenshots-mobile/ IS
# tracked and is not ignored.
docs/qa/screenshots/

